{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c07def2516fffd2af1c9799ef08b9561d722ac1b1fccff0592c689f29419450e", "ja": "（育と志保が出演する映画の撮影日。本日撮る分の\n半分が終了し、次のシーンに向けて準備中だが……）", "zh": "（育和志保出演的电影拍摄日。今天要拍的内容已经完成了一半，现在正在为下一个场景做准备……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "8d79f9fd2d0a2d116c3fc73256ea72e94f53417eb8f0474b746a2fc810015d55", "ja": "おつかれさま、{$P$}さん！\n休憩時間、もうすぐで終わりだよね？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n休息时间马上就要结束了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "7e762acec3f443f8d99a01922b7995c886e194c3778f794105b81772bcb9c241", "ja": "お疲れ様です。\n……あら？　まだスタジオに入れないんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……咦？还不能进摄影棚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6db6f69f6ea5c6080ff93348963c9a50425d1745dc07014529c626ffdd5b3517", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れ様。準備に時間がかかってる\nみたいでね。悪いけど、少し待っててくれるか？", "zh": "你们两个辛苦了。好像准备工作还需要一点时间。不好意思，能再等一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "f8b35b7d3c6249a12f4b41a0f0936dbcdf337e427fdd2bdd9cdb909c76397695", "ja": "わかりました。……育、控室で休んできたらどう？\n朝からの撮影で、疲れてるんじゃない。", "zh": "知道了。……育，要不要去休息室休息一下？从早上就开始拍摄，你应该累了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "dea92ba6f421de937934a973d1a768ca3677ba5b4522d6ab5ec79da1c84331f2", "ja": "ううん！　わたしなら、全然平気だよ！\n志保さんと一緒に、ここで待ってる。", "zh": "不用啦！我完全没事的！\n我要和志保姐一起在这里等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "9912cf1f8c5c9dbe19f0a0dffcf8fc9b1126380d4ad4410cc069b9ed3f9d9d3c", "ja": "そう……。\nでも、もし疲れたり辛くなったら、すぐに言うのよ？", "zh": "这样啊……\n不过，要是累了或者觉得难受，就马上告诉我，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "408165378b2d13a8e3ab89be468cb603582fcd2a9b71feeb98ac7a3e82fb839d", "ja": "むぅ～……わたしのこと、子どもあつかいしてるー。\n今のは、わたしがいうセリフだよ！　志保さん！", "zh": "唔～……志保在把育当小孩子看呢——\n刚才那句话，应该是由育来说的台词才对啦！志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "e781f39b5f3f5ee4263e55b6126c9e97500faff5eab88a9e5b69abf47cd6d006", "ja": "子ども扱いしたつもりじゃないけど……。\nそれより、育のセリフってどういうこと……？", "zh": "我并没有打算把你当小孩子看就是了……\n比起这个，育的台词是什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1009_p", "source_sha256": "03f3c38d94170f016d53ea45d5e5008104a8a1a3372c8a6ccf02134dd92c29a9", "ja": "きっと育は、志保を心配したいんじゃないか。\n今日の育は、志保のお姉さんだもんな？", "zh": "育一定是想担心志保吧。\n今天的育，就像志保的姐姐一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "64467c21cee59c045cb1debcd470c5dea067d76bd5e15134f5ef6a2e6df5069e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、正解！　今日のわたしは\n志保さん……じゃなくて、志保のお姉ちゃんだよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，回答正确！今天的我\n是志保小姐……不对，是志保的姐姐哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "5c089ba00f4bab5b813d11a893ff89eb490d729253a24120bf6d05e127249410", "ja": "わたしは大人だもん！　だから心配しないで？\n自分のことは、自分でちゃんとするから。", "zh": "我可是大人了！所以不用担心哦？\n我自己的事情，自己会好好做好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "ff3bf8318e28c4938b5b0d1d1df2bac7c56bc033ca03cdd418653a99f1db1021", "ja": "育……。ふふっ、そうね。\n口うるさく言ってしまって、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "育……呵呵，说得也是。对你说了那么多，真是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "db3b2b769bf54b528f85c491d9a6c83c80974c8bb8e2ae125dccd19ea146ecf8", "ja": "この映画をたくさんの人に楽しんでもらうために……\n一緒に頑張ろうね、お姉ちゃん。", "zh": "为了让更多人喜欢上这部电影……\n我们一起加油吧，姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "dff16ddbf544cbe7d30bb31137d41ab038835492879cddf8b9960f24cd7b5dcc", "ja": "うん♪　……あっ！　えっと、大人のお姉さんは\nこういう時……うんと……一緒にがんばろうね、志保？", "zh": "嗯♪　……啊！　那个，成熟的大姐姐\n在这种时候……嗯……一起加油吧，志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1016_p", "source_sha256": "26de8a7a58da7e515146b804d705c7b4a34c25a178ceffa6c159616a9ef51bcd", "ja": "合ってるよ、育。\nお姉さんの役作りは、順調みたいだな！", "zh": "演得很对哦，育。\n大姐姐的角色塑造，看来挺顺利的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "0671e592b6ca5b6bc7a174a7dc05601f89dea8761527d2ad2261cb572a96f952", "ja": "よかった……。志保さんと一緒に練習したおかげだよ。\nこのあとの撮影も、お姉ちゃんとしてがんばるね！", "zh": "太好了……多亏了和志保小姐一起练习呢。\n接下来的拍摄，我也会拿出姐姐的样子好好努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "4327d66880609a5c5a8c480ea7864509b8cc29136acfb5f69db98b9fc15e9e18", "ja": "その代わり……クランクアップしたら、\nいーっぱい甘えさせてね？　志保さん♪", "zh": "作为交换……等杀青后，\n要让我尽情撒娇哦？志保姐姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0324_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a474b9270a743be336fa5e9274e2a688910326d943c76ef702d47fc546302a1a", "ja": "（二人なら、仲良し姉妹を素敵に演じてくれるだろう。\nあべこべな姉妹の不思議な物語……完成が楽しみだな）", "zh": "（她们两个人一定能把亲密姐妹演得很精彩吧。姐妹性格截然相反的奇妙故事……真期待完成后的样子啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
